<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ M-3 money supply rose 1.6 pct in August.</title>
<headline>NZ M-3 money supply rose 1.6 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank on Thursday released the following estimated money supply figures for August:</p>
<p>    M3		   August 1996    July 1996	 August 1995</p>
<p>    mthly change     1.6 pct	  -2.0 pct	  1.0 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change 15.7 pct	  15.0 pct	  9.4 pct</p>
<p>Note - M-3 is the Reserve Bank's broad money aggregate and equals M-2 plus all other funding. M-3 (R) is based on M-3 financial institutions' New Zealand dollar funding from New Zealand residents.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
